       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Dose:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The maximum labeled daily dose of ibuprofen for adults is 3,200 mg/day under physician supervision. That is twice the limit.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is also twice the usual maximum of 800 mg per dose.\n- **Risks:** At this dose the risks of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events go up substantially. The patient's normal kidney and liver function doesn't remove that risk.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **600 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **400 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (1,600 mg/day)\n- **1600 mg per day in total**, for example 400 mg four times daily\n\nTell me the dose you want and I'll enter it right away. If 1600 mg four times daily is what you intend, please confirm that. I'd still suggest checking it with pharmacy first."
